    (item "**Compression:** ZLIB (protoOpts & 0x01)")
    (item "**Encryption:** AES-256-GCM (protoOpts & 0x02)")
    (item "**Chunking:** For messages > chunk_size (1024 bytes default)")
    (item "**Multiplexing:** Multiple channels with sequence numbers")
    (para "**Wire Format (16-byte header + data):**")
    (code "[proto(1)] + [protoOpts(1)] + [channelID(2)] + [sequence(4)] +
[chunkIndex(4)] + [totalChunks(4)] + [data(variable)]")
    (para "**Pipeline:**")
    (code "Send: Data → Compress → Encrypt → Chunk → Send chunks
Recv: Receive chunks → Reassemble → Decrypt → Decompress → Deliver")
    (para "**Multiplexing Key:** `(channelID, sequence)` - Each message identified by channel + sequence"))
